# Input

```css
@supports at-rule(@future "\31
x") { .quoted {color:green} }
.control { content: "\31
x"; }
@supports at-rule(@\70
roperty) { .escaped-name { color: red; } }
@supports \61
t-rule(@property) { .escaped-function { color: blue; } }

```


# Options

```json
{
  "formatter": {
    "lineEnding": "crlf"
  }
}
```

